{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_068_1000_p", "source_sha256": "62319e01bde55fc0254339673a6b70c8c23e16087ef496034b0c712e99fa2c7f", "ja": "春香、お疲れ様。公演のブログ見たぞ。\n春香の気持ち、大切な人達に届いてるといいな。", "zh": "春香，辛苦了。我看了演出的博客。\n希望春香的心意，能传达到重要的人们那里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_068_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "bf69ef1d106387a4d6e1958489dd16554121f77209f422b1176cb587037bb9d5", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nあの……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_068_1002_p", "source_sha256": "71870e9dde3ec9a3d3a5006aa86eae8bbb9411133e73a2c60ca1daf342b3162e", "ja": "ん？　どうかしたのか、春香。", "zh": "嗯？怎么了，春香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_068_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "101505929c85bf5a5dc740b1fb4b1954e3e9fd180d7f40b417e13a424e8a9886", "ja": "私、今回の公演……美咲さんに、会場の一番見やすい\n席を取っておいてほしいって、お願いしたんです。", "zh": "我……拜托美咲小姐，帮我在这次公演里，留一个会场里视野最好的座位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_068_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "7e1f409f0783d68ef84b0be821bf31baf3b6eca8766df2a8d0ba4d7fe2ba7aa7", "ja": "{$P$}さんに、座ってほしくて。", "zh": "想让{$P$}先生坐在那里看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_068_1005_p", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_068_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "e276e031f1bc6c65dd5a50a749f11c91b5a7cc839c23c8e3dc474ad9ea74f299", "ja": "今までで一番って言える、最高のステージにしたくて。\nだから、近くで見てほしいと思ったんです。", "zh": "我想把它变成能够称得上是至今为止最棒的舞台。\n所以，我希望你能在近处看着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_068_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4c8ba67d27bf1986bdab607a3f9853f7e083311d9f8885b300d0882b6b22b8ce", "ja": "そうだったか。\n……けど、俺はその席には座れないよ。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n……不过，我没法坐在那个座位上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_068_1008_p", "source_sha256": "7ac537f8b00f64ad29c557c8fbb21361f70498c0233fdf2692fd904896f263ba", "ja": "俺はプロデューサーとして、アイドルの春香を\n見守りたいからな。舞台袖が、俺の特等席だから。", "zh": "因为我作为制作人，想守护偶像春香。所以舞台侧台就是我的专属席位。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_068_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "f712e81082bfafbba0b86e5ba5329e1ffef3a4c1490fd667fa763a8db1ed0342", "ja": "そうですよね。{$P$}さんには、\nやっぱり、いつもの場所じゃなくちゃ。", "zh": "就是嘛。对{$P$}先生来说，果然还是得待在平时的位置才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_068_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "4f6dacd0b9f2486587eb7578f9d86f62e5b3c361e2f39915767601e4aa674141", "ja": "私も、そう思って……\nお願いしていた席は、当日券にしてもらいました。", "zh": "我也这么想……所以就把之前拜托预留的座位改成了当天票。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_068_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "e7811908cf3c97fd1a9b6b88c1503985c4b7d46067b3696f50587c0a144298f8", "ja": "それで……えっと。特に何か続きがあるわけじゃ\nなくて、そ、それだけなんですけど……。", "zh": "所以……那个。也不是还有什么后续，只、只是这样而已……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_068_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f29955d34b4182a45c7e0d6ea1cc2bec900a49af3d260e049132235b89ac1a7d", "ja": "あ、いや。改めて言うのもなんだけど、\nこれからもよろしく頼むよ、春香。", "zh": "啊，不，虽然现在再说有点奇怪，不过今后也拜托你了，春香。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_068_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "2ce76a60dbd951c8823869ffa8eafe253483711d7bcdb2314e771cd10603762b", "ja": "あっ、わっ、こ、こちらこそ！　よろしく\nお願いします、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "啊、哇、我、我才是！今后还请多多关照，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_068_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "f6d9466537ffc60024feb1532aa221289bc34b1d23dd9dae446f9efe095ee103", "ja": "……って、えへへ。なんだか本当に、アイドルに\nなったばかりの頃のこと、思い出しちゃいますね。", "zh": "……嘿嘿。总觉得，真的让我想起了刚成为偶像那时候的事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_068_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "11a92cf7ce8ba54bf09cc9930922e8fcf45fca52c6c17a288d0426caab764743", "ja": "これからも一緒に、夢を見ましょうね。\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "今后也一起怀抱梦想吧。\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_068_1018_p", "source_sha256": "fe105b0f1f5b193527b9d795a7ae00786e17a5e1f96e37e40e09d21cb74edf62", "ja": "ああ。俺達の夢を……もっと多くの人に届けよう。", "zh": "嗯。把我们的梦想……传达给更多的人吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_068_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_068_1019_p", "source_sha256": "1bfaff71b9d90cb4596c5afd8a6fb531066ba44247e2a9839a6f22d65fb1f22a", "ja": "（夢は終わらない。春香はたとえ何度転んでも、\n自分の道を進むだろう。俺や、仲間達と一緒に……）", "zh": "（梦想不会结束。春香就算跌倒无数次，\n也一定会继续走自己的路。和我，还有伙伴们一起……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
